1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,080
All depicted events are fictional

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,960
and for entertainment purposes only.
viewer discretion is advised.

3
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,640
<i>Should we meet at</i>
<i>the appointed time and place,</i>

4
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,160
<i>we shall capture Cherd.</i>

5
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,840
Should we manage to capture him,

6
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:27,480
we might be able to find
whoever framed my father.

7
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:28,400
Phop,

8
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,880
tell me everything that you know
about my father.

9
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,440
<i>You already know, do you not?</i>

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,120
<i>I must accompany Father to Phichit.</i>

11
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,040
<i>I do not wish to be parted from you.</i>

12
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:43,520
PHICHIT

13
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:49,160
We are officials of the state,

14
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:51,840
entrusted with the duty
of safeguarding the people.

15
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:55,480
Having been granted a life far more
bountiful than that of the common folk,

16
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,400
we cannot commit such an act.

17
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,320
I shall accept only your kindness.

18
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:03,080
As for all else,

19
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,680
I must most respectfully decline.

20
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,080
Who might that be?

21
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:52,720
I know not, Master. I know only that
he is a nobleman from the capital.

22
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:00,600
Father.

23
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,280
Father.

24
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,840
Has something occurred?

25
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:14,280
There is nothing for you
to trouble your heart over, son.

26
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,880
I have already settled the matter.

27
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:19,680
Son,

28
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:21,720
you have been studying all day.

29
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,680
Are you weary?

30
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,000
I am,

31
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,000
yet I do so with all my heart.

32
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:32,000
Perhaps, when the day comes
that I become an official,

33
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,960
I may ease the burden upon your shoulders.

34
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,040
My deepest thanks, son.

35
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,680
I entrust the hopes of our future to you.

36
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,480
Yes, Father.

37
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,600
But if it is too wearisome,

38
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,840
on the morrow

39
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:48,280
shall we venture to the market?

40
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,920
A splendid idea, my Lord.

41
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:52,240
Chuay.

42
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:53,800
It appears you are eager

43
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,680
to accompany my son on this outing.

44
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,840
If that be the case,

45
00:02:57,920 --> 00:03:00,200
how about you set forth
and wait for us at the market?

46
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,440
Wonderful idea, my Lord.

47
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,480
I shall take my leave.

48
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,680
The hour is late.

49
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,240
Look at him.

50
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,640
Chuay.

51
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,680
Are you so eager to set forth?

52
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,160
Very well, onward.

53
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:21,760
Let us depart.

54
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,600
We shall set out at this hour.

55
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,480
-Come.
-Master Klao.

56
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,400
-Now.
-Master!

57
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:28,320
Chuay, do take good care of my son,
will you?

58
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,240
Yes, my Lord!

59
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,200
Father, can you truly not tell me

60
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,440
when you shall return?

61
00:03:57,600 --> 00:04:00,200
High Lord Phichaiphakdi
has given no word regarding my return.

62
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:03,040
But I believe it shall be brief.

63
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:06,480
His Excellency requires my aid
in matters of tongue

64
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,840
to interrogate and examine

65
00:04:08,920 --> 00:04:11,040
the Chinese and the Farangi merchants

66
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,440
regarding the smuggling of opium.

67
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,440
Remain here and await my return.

68
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,680
But…

69
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,720
I wish to accompany you.

70
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,040
I wish to see Phop.

71
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:33,120
Endure this bitter patience
for a sweeter reward.

72
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,280
Once the examinations are over,

73
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:42,400
I shall escort you back to the capital.

74
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,800
Forgive me, son,

75
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,480
for leaving you to endure such solitude.

76
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,400
I pray this mission

77
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:11,200
shall reach a swift and successful end.

78
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:17,440
Should His Excellency favor our service,

79
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,680
I shall petition for

80
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,600
my reassignment to the capital,

81
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:34,080
and you shall no longer need to be
so far from your brother.

82
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,520
Yes, Father.

83
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,280
How peculiar.

84
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:26,280
Those fluent in the tongues of
the Chinese and the Farangi

85
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:28,200
are plentiful in the capital.

86
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,840
Why then must they require my father?

87
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,640
What did you say?

88
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:51,280
The Lord was apprehended
for assisting Chinese merchants

89
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,440
in smuggling opium.

90
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,440
It cannot be.

91
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,920
My father is a man of integrity.

92
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,760
It is certain that he has been framed.

93
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,080
Chuay.

94
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,400
Gather my belongings.

95
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,240
We shall depart this very instant.

96
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:11,160
Yes, Master.

97
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:20,280
The said vessel had illicitly conveyed

98
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:23,320
a vast quantity of opium into the kingdom.

99
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:26,920
Furthermore, a warrant was discovered

100
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:30,200
permitting the vessel
to pass through the river's mouth

101
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,920
without being searched.

102
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,840
Lord Preechaphibal.

103
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:50,360
Will you confess to your misdeeds?

104
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,640
The Legal Principles decree that

105
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:59,360
whosoever is found guilty of bribery,

106
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:01,280
or of engaging in corruption,

107
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,840
such as the trafficking of opium,

108
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:09,920
shall receive 50 lashes upon the back,

109
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:12,880
be subjected to a fourfold fine,

110
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:16,000
and condemned to a life of servitude.

111
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,360
Father!

112
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:17,000
<i>Memories of my father are back.</i>

113
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,200
<i>It went much like what Phop told me,</i>

114
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,160
<i>but one thing is bugging me.</i>

115
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,040
<i>That sword.</i>

116
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:27,040
<i>Where have I seen it before?</i>

117
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,560
Phop.

118
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:47,760
Kindly partake of a little sustenance.

119
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,280
Dear Klao.

120
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,600
Phop.

121
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,240
If you have no appetite,

122
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:36,680
at least dine with me.

123
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,160
Without you,
how shall I endure this existence?

124
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:06,920
Dear Klao.

125
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,280
Come with me.

126
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,800
I must now take my leave, Aunt.

127
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,000
Good heavens!

128
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:56,560
When Master Klao disappeared,

129
00:13:56,640 --> 00:13:59,000
Lord Phop's physical condition
declined greatly.

130
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:02,120
Should they be separated once more,

131
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:04,720
I fear that he will perish.

132
00:14:22,720 --> 00:14:23,560
Dear Klao.

133
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:28,040
I have secured you a post
in the official service of Lavo.

134
00:14:29,240 --> 00:14:31,200
Gather your belongings
and depart on the morrow.

135
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:39,520
I offer my deepest gratitude,
Your Excellency,

136
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,920
for overseeing this matter.

137
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:45,160
But…
I fear I am unable to depart.

138
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:53,280
I…

139
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:57,200
Whatever hardships I might suffer,

140
00:14:57,280 --> 00:14:58,440
I care not.

141
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:02,400
Yet, if I am no longer by his side,

142
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:06,400
Phop shall surely perish.

143
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:16,200
And have you not considered it?

144
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:19,160
How would you and Phop

145
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,600
live together

146
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:24,080
without inviting cruel gossip?

147
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,440
I have raised him with the utmost care.

148
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:35,080
I shall never permit harm to come to him.

149
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:44,080
I ask only to share this heavy burden.

150
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:49,560
I pray you permit me
to watch over Phop in your stead.

151
00:15:58,400 --> 00:15:59,920
I beg of you.

152
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,880
If you truly look upon me

153
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:05,440
as one of your own kin,

154
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:09,640
a child of your dearest friend,
as you once mentioned,

155
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:14,040
do not force me to part from his side.

156
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,240
Klao! Depart at once.

157
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:24,160
Both of us shall set forth.

158
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,120
Should he leave the manor,

159
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:33,720
I too shall depart.

160
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:39,280
All my life,
I have lived solely for your sake.

161
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:44,160
I devoted myself to my studies,

162
00:16:44,800 --> 00:16:46,600
and I gave my heart to royal service

163
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:48,400
and to my work, all for your sake.

164
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:51,280
Even my marriage to Lady Varna,

165
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,440
I dared not refuse,

166
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:58,400
for the deep reverence I bear you.

167
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,160
But from this moment forth,

168
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:09,640
permit me, if only for once,

169
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:16,240
to follow my own heart for my own sake.

170
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,840
Phop…

171
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:36,000
Rise, I beg you.

172
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,120
Dear Klao, pray rise.

173
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:52,280
One cannot simply follow the whims
of one's own heart in every matter, Phop.

174
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:56,040
Such a path would
bring ruin upon your life.

175
00:17:58,120 --> 00:17:59,200
Indeed, Father.

176
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:03,120
This is my life.

177
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:07,280
Should ruin come,

178
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:11,480
let it come by my own hand,

179
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:14,000
and not by yours, Father.

180
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,000
Phop.

181
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:19,640
Compose yourself, I beg of you.

182
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:25,960
My Love,

183
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,880
speak with patience and restraint.

184
00:18:29,520 --> 00:18:32,640
Do not hasten your judgment
while your mind is troubled.

185
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,000
Let it be, Lady Prayong.

186
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:45,720
I shall no longer render decisions
on Phop's behalf.

187
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:55,120
Go forth and live your own life.

188
00:18:59,520 --> 00:19:02,040
I shall concern myself
with your affairs no longer.

189
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,400
Phop, what do you--

190
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:47,520
What do you intend to do?

191
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:53,040
Surely your father
must be deeply angry with you.

192
00:19:57,520 --> 00:20:00,560
This means that
his heart has already softened.

193
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:05,960
From this day forth,
no matter what may happen,

194
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:09,520
I shall not let go of your hand.

195
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:27,040
As a mother,

196
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,040
I would sacrifice all.

197
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:30,920
But I cannot bear
to see my child suffer thus, Physician.

198
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,240
Therefore, I implore you

199
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:33,840
to save my child. I beg of you.

200
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:35,800
Be that as it may.

201
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:53,560
Do you keep a dog at this manor,
Physician?

202
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:56,480
Kaew.

203
00:20:58,720 --> 00:20:59,640
Behold.

204
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:00,920
It is a dog.

205
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,360
Oh my!

206
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:23,520
All sorts of sweets and confections.

207
00:21:23,600 --> 00:21:24,960
They look utterly delectable.

208
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:27,880
Not true. It is merely a ruse
to make me take my remedy.

209
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:31,040
It is no ruse.

210
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:38,280
Remarkably sweet. It truly is a delight.

211
00:21:38,360 --> 00:21:39,480
Will you not join me?

212
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:02,840
You have my thanks.

213
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:14,840
Where shall the dog wander?

214
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,760
This way, perhaps?

215
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:17,800
Can you guess?

216
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:19,240
Perhaps it is this way?

217
00:22:21,920 --> 00:22:23,040
Or is it this way?

218
00:22:31,760 --> 00:22:32,840
Kaew, you are remarkable.

219
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,840
You have soothed
my daughter's fear of the physician.

220
00:22:40,080 --> 00:22:41,760
Come back and play with the dog again.

221
00:22:56,560 --> 00:22:59,640
How did you manage to persuade that child?

222
00:23:00,320 --> 00:23:01,440
It is quite simple.

223
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:04,160
I spend my days preparing sweets
day in and day out.

224
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:07,200
Simply coating your herbal remedies
with honey

225
00:23:07,280 --> 00:23:08,600
will make them more palatable.

226
00:23:11,080 --> 00:23:12,760
I shall remember that.

227
00:23:16,280 --> 00:23:17,800
By seeking me out in this manner,

228
00:23:18,800 --> 00:23:21,000
-have you truly forgiven me?
-No.

229
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:22,040
However,

230
00:23:23,520 --> 00:23:25,200
Buaphan learned from Chuay that

231
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:27,800
a grave matter had arisen at Phop's manor.

232
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,760
Thus, I have come
to urge you to visit Klao.

233
00:23:31,880 --> 00:23:33,560
Go, if you will.

234
00:23:34,840 --> 00:23:36,120
Do as you please.

235
00:23:48,760 --> 00:23:50,400
If your heart truly harbors such anger,

236
00:23:51,520 --> 00:23:53,800
why did you come to my manor
seeking me out, Kaew?

237
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:06,240
It brings me joy to see you smile.

238
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:09,160
Buaphan said
you quarreled with His Excellency.

239
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:10,520
So I thought…

240
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:12,600
Well…

241
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:14,400
We did have a quarrel.

242
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:15,840
But…

243
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:19,040
when Phop confessed his love
before his father,

244
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:21,080
I knew then that,

245
00:24:21,600 --> 00:24:23,440
no matter the hardships we might face,

246
00:24:23,520 --> 00:24:25,720
we should endure them together.

247
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:33,880
Since Jom has chosen to accompany you,

248
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:36,040
does this mean

249
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:39,080
you will no longer journey
to Pak Nam Pho, Kaew?

250
00:24:50,960 --> 00:24:51,800
Kaew.

251
00:24:53,120 --> 00:24:54,960
I have a matter to discuss with you.

252
00:24:55,040 --> 00:24:56,360
I came here to see Klao,

253
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:57,640
not to speak with you.

254
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:04,240
Klao.

255
00:25:04,320 --> 00:25:05,560
And what of Aunt Bud?

256
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:07,920
Did she truly bring
the enemy to your doorstep?

257
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:13,400
We have no concrete evidence

258
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:15,920
of her conspiring with Cherd.

259
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:17,760
However…

260
00:25:18,560 --> 00:25:21,320
Aunt had her sent to a small manor.

261
00:25:22,840 --> 00:25:24,240
Once her anger has abated,

262
00:25:24,320 --> 00:25:25,720
she shall return here.

263
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:32,400
And what of the lady
at the House of Pleasure?

264
00:25:33,800 --> 00:25:35,600
Knowing how much you love Phop,

265
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:39,600
I find it hard to believe
you have any affection for that lady,

266
00:25:39,680 --> 00:25:40,520
as rumor has it.

267
00:25:41,840 --> 00:25:44,720
Is there perchance anything
you wish to tell me?

268
00:25:50,600 --> 00:25:51,440
Chuay,

269
00:25:52,360 --> 00:25:53,840
have the servants go away at once.

270
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:54,840
Yes, my Lord.

271
00:25:55,520 --> 00:25:56,480
Let us leave.

272
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:13,040
So this is the reason
you visit to the market,

273
00:26:13,120 --> 00:26:14,200
the tavern,

274
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:16,120
and the House of Pleasure?

275
00:26:17,800 --> 00:26:19,520
Pray, accept my apologies.

276
00:26:19,600 --> 00:26:21,160
I misjudged you.

277
00:26:22,480 --> 00:26:23,800
In truth,

278
00:26:23,880 --> 00:26:26,480
you came to learn the truth
concerning your father.

279
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:30,640
And all this while,
you have borne it entirely alone.

280
00:26:34,760 --> 00:26:35,640
Forgive me.

281
00:26:36,240 --> 00:26:38,680
I kept it from you
not because I distrusted you,

282
00:26:39,440 --> 00:26:40,480
but rather…

283
00:26:40,560 --> 00:26:42,280
because I wished to bring no trouble.

284
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:50,360
Klao.

285
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:52,880
Henceforth, should any trouble arise,

286
00:26:52,960 --> 00:26:54,760
do not hesitate to speak to Jom and me.

287
00:26:55,560 --> 00:26:56,840
We are willing to help you.

288
00:26:59,400 --> 00:27:00,520
You have my gratitude.

289
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:03,600
Strangely enough, I require your aid.

290
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:11,440
At this hour,

291
00:27:11,520 --> 00:27:13,920
His Excellency and the lady
are not at the manor.

292
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:17,560
This gives me the opportunity
to search the quarters.

293
00:27:19,200 --> 00:27:20,960
You two must delay the servants

294
00:27:21,480 --> 00:27:23,800
and ensure that
no one sets foot in the manor.

295
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:30,160
This is no time to set foot in the manor!

296
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:32,480
Help me search for Dear Kaew's ring.

297
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,160
What of that tree?

298
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,760
Do climb up and take a look.

299
00:27:48,760 --> 00:27:49,680
<i>Swords?</i>

300
00:27:49,760 --> 00:27:51,600
<i>His Excellency seldom bears his sword.</i>

301
00:27:51,680 --> 00:27:53,280
<i>He looks rather majestic.</i>

302
00:27:53,360 --> 00:27:56,160
<i>-Who might that be?</i>
<i>-A nobleman from the capital.</i>

303
00:28:10,200 --> 00:28:11,240
<i>Phop's father…</i>

304
00:28:11,320 --> 00:28:12,440
<i>He killed me?</i>

305
00:28:18,960 --> 00:28:20,320
<i>Being his close friend,</i>

306
00:28:21,120 --> 00:28:23,160
<i>he led my father into opium corruption.</i>

307
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:24,680
<i>My father refused.</i>

308
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:26,840
<i>So he framed him?</i>

309
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:33,840
<i>If he really framed my father,</i>

310
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:35,800
<i>then taking me into the manor</i>
<i>would only serve</i>

311
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:38,680
<i>to track everything I do.</i>

312
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:40,960
<i>This means it is here.</i>

313
00:28:41,040 --> 00:28:42,840
Furthermore, a warrant was discovered

314
00:28:42,920 --> 00:28:45,320
permitting the vessel
to pass through the river's mouth

315
00:28:45,400 --> 00:28:46,600
without being searched.

316
00:28:48,080 --> 00:28:50,720
<i>Is that forged warrant</i>
<i>with my father's fake signature</i>

317
00:28:51,760 --> 00:28:53,120
<i>with Uncle?</i>

318
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:04,880
<i>A key.</i>

319
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:06,160
<i>A key, a key.</i>

320
00:30:06,280 --> 00:30:10,880
MY DEAR FRIEND

321
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:21,240
YOU MUST NOT COME TO THE CAPITAL

322
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:31,960
Are you looking for this?

323
00:30:48,040 --> 00:30:48,920
Jom.

324
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:50,400
Kaew.

325
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:52,080
Leave the manor for now.

326
00:31:06,320 --> 00:31:07,920
How did that document…

327
00:31:11,760 --> 00:31:14,840
I sent my men to retrieve this evidence
from within the capital.

328
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:20,240
The handwriting in the letters
we exchanged

329
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,720
and this document…

330
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:26,560
is undoubtedly that of Lord Preechaphibal.

331
00:31:27,600 --> 00:31:28,840
See for yourself.

332
00:31:29,920 --> 00:31:33,040
Examine it with your own eyes.

333
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:35,640
The chest is yours to examine.

334
00:32:03,280 --> 00:32:04,240
And…

335
00:32:06,120 --> 00:32:07,520
What about those swords?

336
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:14,720
Any officer of the rank of Lord or higher
is entitled to carry a sword.

337
00:32:16,040 --> 00:32:18,040
Do my swords trouble you in any way?

338
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:26,680
Uncle…

339
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:29,480
I ask for your forgiveness.

340
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:35,680
Should you punish him,

341
00:32:37,760 --> 00:32:39,640
punish me as well.

342
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:44,680
It is my fault for failing to guide him.

343
00:32:50,120 --> 00:32:52,360
I shall not hold this against you.

344
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:02,120
Take the utmost care of yourself.

345
00:33:05,120 --> 00:33:06,280
As for the case,

346
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:09,440
I have long been plagued by guilt

347
00:33:10,040 --> 00:33:11,640
for failing to save my dearest friend.

348
00:33:13,360 --> 00:33:14,360
But this time,

349
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:17,800
I shall be the one to aid you.

350
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:25,960
I cannot condone your romance with Phop,

351
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:32,080
yet my affection for you

352
00:33:33,320 --> 00:33:36,160
remains as though
you were my own flesh and blood.

353
00:33:44,280 --> 00:33:47,120
I am profoundly grateful to you,
Your Excellency.

354
00:33:58,360 --> 00:34:00,000
Thank you, Father.

355
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:14,520
This is all I could do for your son,

356
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:17,080
Lord Preechaphibal,

357
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:19,400
my dear friend.

358
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:25,800
The handwriting is indeed identical.

359
00:34:27,120 --> 00:34:29,159
Yet my father never smudged ink.

360
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,520
Why then is there an ink blot here
and nowhere else?

361
00:34:50,159 --> 00:34:52,000
Why did you enter my father's quarters?

362
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:54,280
Were you suspicious of him?

363
00:34:56,639 --> 00:34:57,480
I…

364
00:34:58,640 --> 00:35:00,520
The sword I saw there

365
00:35:00,600 --> 00:35:02,560
was similar to the one I saw in my dream.

366
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:05,680
Thus, I suspected him.

367
00:35:06,640 --> 00:35:08,800
I only came to realize that

368
00:35:09,560 --> 00:35:11,720
all the patrolmen carry swords like his.

369
00:35:14,120 --> 00:35:16,480
This makes everything more difficult.

370
00:35:16,560 --> 00:35:17,760
No.

371
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:19,400
Quite the opposite.

372
00:35:20,720 --> 00:35:22,640
Now we know with certainty that

373
00:35:22,720 --> 00:35:24,840
the one who framed your father

374
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:28,600
must be an officer
of the rank of Lord or higher.

375
00:35:30,640 --> 00:35:32,800
This eliminates a great many
within the capital.

376
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:34,920
It does indeed.

377
00:35:41,120 --> 00:35:43,920
"The warrant permits the ship from China

378
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:47,040
to pass through the river's mouth
without being searched."

379
00:35:52,440 --> 00:35:56,160
You were there to see a certain lady

380
00:35:56,240 --> 00:35:59,360
who was accompanied
by a Chinese Port Master.

381
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:03,600
<i>Do you suspect that Chinese man,</i>
<i>the one with Pim,</i>

382
00:36:04,480 --> 00:36:07,000
whom Meng says you quarreled with?

383
00:36:14,040 --> 00:36:15,240
<i>How could she not be here?</i>

384
00:36:16,240 --> 00:36:17,680
Every time I have come,

385
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:19,480
Pim has always been here.

386
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:22,680
She has fallen grievously ill

387
00:36:22,760 --> 00:36:24,960
and has returned to Suvarnabhumi.

388
00:36:25,040 --> 00:36:26,680
Fallen grievously ill?

389
00:36:27,520 --> 00:36:28,520
What ails her?

390
00:36:30,680 --> 00:36:32,640
Perhaps it is a venereal illness.

391
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:35,080
She will likely be away for a few nights.

392
00:36:36,600 --> 00:36:40,280
Allow Puang to attend to you
in her stead tonight.

393
00:36:46,640 --> 00:36:47,880
It is quite all right.

394
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:49,840
I shall take my leave.

395
00:36:51,720 --> 00:36:53,240
Master Klao!

396
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:55,320
Do not leave just now.

397
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:57,280
I have many tricks, Master.

398
00:36:57,360 --> 00:36:58,520
No charge for this service.

399
00:36:59,920 --> 00:37:01,240
Master Klao!

400
00:37:08,520 --> 00:37:10,400
I went there in vain.

401
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:14,080
The teahouse was already closed
at that hour.

402
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:16,320
I am so weary, Phop.

403
00:37:17,560 --> 00:37:19,120
Rest if need be.

404
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:21,400
Would you like to sleep now?

405
00:37:23,520 --> 00:37:25,640
I may find it hard to do so.

406
00:37:26,840 --> 00:37:27,920
Are you feeling sleepy?

407
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:31,240
If such is the case,
I shall return to my quarters.

408
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:34,320
In that case, I fear I cannot find rest,

409
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:36,360
for I shall miss your warmth.

410
00:37:36,440 --> 00:37:38,440
I might shiver myself to death.

411
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:42,920
Then…

412
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:45,200
Let us sleep in each other's arms.

413
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:05,880
I wish to cherish this moment
every day and night.

414
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:09,040
I do not wish us
to be torn apart ever again.

415
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:17,720
I believe my father's heart has softened.

416
00:38:19,120 --> 00:38:20,840
So, you may rest easy now.

417
00:38:25,200 --> 00:38:26,720
Do you recall

418
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:28,920
that time when you fell ill?

419
00:38:30,920 --> 00:38:33,040
I came in and sponged you down.

420
00:38:35,760 --> 00:38:36,880
I do.

421
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,720
Chuay told me about it.

422
00:38:40,200 --> 00:38:42,360
You lapsed into delirium from the fever,

423
00:38:43,240 --> 00:38:45,320
saying in your sleep
you wished to go home.

424
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:47,440
I whispered something

425
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:49,400
to you,

426
00:38:50,560 --> 00:38:52,120
though I believe you remember it not.

427
00:38:54,120 --> 00:38:56,280
So, I shall say it again now.

428
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:04,400
Even if my father forbids
your staying here,

429
00:39:06,160 --> 00:39:08,120
I shall follow.

430
00:39:09,920 --> 00:39:12,160
Wherever we may find ourselves,

431
00:39:14,640 --> 00:39:16,360
I shall be your home.

432
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:43,720
What are you doing?

433
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:45,920
The tip of the roof.

434
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:48,080
You are my home, are you not?

435
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:53,880
Let me feel your tip.

436
00:39:53,960 --> 00:39:56,160
Can I feel it tonight?

437
00:39:56,240 --> 00:39:57,440
Stop it. Stop.

438
00:40:07,960 --> 00:40:09,040
Stop it, Phop!

439
00:40:09,600 --> 00:40:10,720
Let go of me!

440
00:40:13,520 --> 00:40:15,600
-Let me feel it then.
-No.

441
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:18,960
-If your father hears us…
-No.

442
00:40:19,040 --> 00:40:20,640
Hey, stop it already.

443
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:47,840
Master, I beg of you, tell me.

444
00:40:47,920 --> 00:40:49,840
I shall buy out all the tea
in this teahouse,

445
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,400
every last pot of it.

446
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:52,800
Every last pot of it, you say?

447
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:54,680
Good.

448
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:58,600
A promise made is a promise kept.

449
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:04,840
<i>The Chinese man whom Pim accompanied</i>

450
00:41:04,920 --> 00:41:06,920
<i>holds a position in Krom Tha Sai.</i>

451
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:11,560
Krom Tha Sai is responsible
for overseeing the Chinese,

452
00:41:11,640 --> 00:41:14,320
Vietnamese, and Japanese communities
in the capital,

453
00:41:14,400 --> 00:41:17,120
as well as managing royal junks
engaged in trade with those lands,

454
00:41:17,200 --> 00:41:18,200
but chiefly the Chinese.

455
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,200
If such is the case,

456
00:41:21,280 --> 00:41:22,720
it would come as no surprise

457
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:25,560
if someone had forged
my father's signature

458
00:41:25,640 --> 00:41:28,520
to permit those Chinese junks
carrying opium

459
00:41:28,600 --> 00:41:29,920
to sail into our lands.

460
00:41:33,120 --> 00:41:35,000
Who might that Chinese man be?

461
00:41:35,640 --> 00:41:37,840
I am not certain of his identity.

462
00:41:37,920 --> 00:41:41,320
But Pim is the most beautiful lady

463
00:41:41,400 --> 00:41:44,640
in the Pavilion of Affection.

464
00:41:45,720 --> 00:41:48,120
She caters to the elite,

465
00:41:48,200 --> 00:41:50,240
and that Chinese man must therefore

466
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:53,480
<i>be a person of considerable influence.</i>

467
00:41:54,360 --> 00:41:57,800
If so, we must seek him out
at the Royal Treasury.

468
00:41:58,880 --> 00:41:59,760
Where might that be?

469
00:41:59,840 --> 00:42:01,240
Pray, take me there, Phop.

470
00:42:02,040 --> 00:42:04,520
Why leave?

471
00:42:04,600 --> 00:42:06,560
We are already here.

472
00:42:06,640 --> 00:42:08,280
-Right on cue.
-Unhand me.

473
00:42:08,360 --> 00:42:09,400
Draw him closer

474
00:42:09,480 --> 00:42:11,680
-and hold him tight.
-What?

475
00:42:11,760 --> 00:42:14,040
Finger of grace.

476
00:42:15,080 --> 00:42:16,120
Do not harm me!

477
00:42:30,760 --> 00:42:31,760
Master.

478
00:42:32,360 --> 00:42:33,280
Thong.

479
00:42:33,360 --> 00:42:35,120
Pray, cease this.

480
00:42:38,680 --> 00:42:39,800
Was it you

481
00:42:40,720 --> 00:42:43,080
who conspired with the man
who framed my father?

482
00:42:43,160 --> 00:42:44,280
Unhand me.

483
00:42:45,200 --> 00:42:46,520
I do not know you.

484
00:42:46,600 --> 00:42:47,440
It is only that

485
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:50,200
I fear the violence
you have inflicted upon me in the past.

486
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:52,720
Do you know Lord Preechaphibal?

487
00:42:52,800 --> 00:42:54,960
Lord Preecha…

488
00:42:55,760 --> 00:42:56,920
phibal…

489
00:42:59,080 --> 00:42:59,920
Who might that be?

490
00:43:04,120 --> 00:43:07,440
You once signed the warrant
that allowed those junks

491
00:43:08,080 --> 00:43:11,120
to pass without being searched,
did you not?

492
00:43:11,200 --> 00:43:12,320
I…

493
00:43:12,400 --> 00:43:13,240
I…

494
00:43:14,080 --> 00:43:16,240
The man who signed it

495
00:43:16,320 --> 00:43:18,560
was the father of my relative,

496
00:43:18,640 --> 00:43:20,760
a man to whom I owe filial respect as--

497
00:43:20,840 --> 00:43:21,960
Enough!

498
00:43:22,720 --> 00:43:24,440
Unhand him, Klao.

499
00:43:24,520 --> 00:43:26,640
The person who signed it

500
00:43:27,160 --> 00:43:29,600
must be a high-ranking official,

501
00:43:30,640 --> 00:43:32,680
likely older than this man.

502
00:43:37,080 --> 00:43:38,160
What a waste of time.

503
00:43:41,360 --> 00:43:43,400
It would be easier to find the forger

504
00:43:43,480 --> 00:43:45,840
than to find the truth
in the Port Department.

505
00:43:46,960 --> 00:43:50,440
It seems you must return to
the Pavilion of Affection

506
00:43:50,520 --> 00:43:52,840
and draw the truth from Pim.

507
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:56,160
This is our only path forward.

508
00:44:00,120 --> 00:44:02,040
But Pim would likely flee from me.

509
00:44:03,160 --> 00:44:06,760
Asking you and Chuay
to wear other disguises

510
00:44:06,840 --> 00:44:08,480
may no longer suffice.

511
00:44:14,440 --> 00:44:15,360
Chuay.

512
00:44:16,360 --> 00:44:17,920
We need a helping hand.

513
00:44:19,080 --> 00:44:20,160
My Lord,

514
00:44:20,240 --> 00:44:21,800
what would you have me do this time?

515
00:44:21,880 --> 00:44:23,720
I am too afraid to wear
a woman's disguise.

516
00:44:23,800 --> 00:44:25,600
I meant not that.

517
00:44:25,680 --> 00:44:27,960
Summon the physician and Kaew to me.

518
00:44:50,480 --> 00:44:52,680
Jom, cease your pursuit of me.

519
00:44:52,760 --> 00:44:55,080
It is most irritating.
I am here to select fabric.

520
00:44:55,160 --> 00:44:56,680
Well, I am here to assist you.

521
00:45:02,920 --> 00:45:04,560
-You like this.
-This one?

522
00:45:13,440 --> 00:45:14,480
I shall take this one.

523
00:45:14,560 --> 00:45:15,480
Certainly.

524
00:45:25,760 --> 00:45:27,920
That is the son of High Lord Sintaranurak.

525
00:45:28,000 --> 00:45:29,360
They say he is effeminate.

526
00:45:33,000 --> 00:45:34,560
And it would appear to be true.

527
00:45:35,240 --> 00:45:37,200
He seems to be procuring a lady's item.

528
00:45:37,840 --> 00:45:38,680
How peculiar.

529
00:45:44,720 --> 00:45:45,800
Jom.

530
00:45:47,080 --> 00:45:47,960
Let us leave.

531
00:45:48,840 --> 00:45:50,720
It is you who are peculiar.

532
00:45:52,600 --> 00:45:55,280
What kind of man speaks ill of
others without a hint of shame?

533
00:45:56,960 --> 00:45:59,000
Kaew has done no wrong.

534
00:45:59,640 --> 00:46:01,600
He merely favors things unlike others.

535
00:46:01,680 --> 00:46:03,080
Protecting one another.

536
00:46:04,680 --> 00:46:06,320
One might think you are spouses.

537
00:46:06,400 --> 00:46:07,800
Or is it merely a passing fancy?

538
00:46:43,280 --> 00:46:44,120
And so?

539
00:46:44,200 --> 00:46:46,400
Find a soul as gracious as my spouse,
if you can.

540
00:47:17,520 --> 00:47:18,440
Thank you.

541
00:47:27,960 --> 00:47:31,680
You have my deepest gratitude
for protecting me.

542
00:47:33,200 --> 00:47:35,160
But calling me your spouse…

543
00:47:37,320 --> 00:47:38,640
Do not address me as such.

544
00:47:39,520 --> 00:47:40,960
It is not to my liking.

545
00:47:41,920 --> 00:47:42,920
Forgive me.

546
00:47:44,240 --> 00:47:45,920
-I thought--
-Never again.

547
00:47:49,120 --> 00:47:49,960
Because…

548
00:47:51,680 --> 00:47:52,960
you have never asked.

549
00:47:55,920 --> 00:47:57,240
If that is so,

550
00:47:57,320 --> 00:47:59,120
I shall ask you this very instant.

551
00:48:03,120 --> 00:48:04,520
Jom.

552
00:48:06,040 --> 00:48:07,680
Why do you…

553
00:48:11,320 --> 00:48:13,400
In your absence,

554
00:48:13,480 --> 00:48:14,760
I felt as though

555
00:48:15,440 --> 00:48:18,600
the other half of my very soul
had vanished.

556
00:48:20,200 --> 00:48:22,000
Without you by my side to assist me,

557
00:48:23,000 --> 00:48:24,480
to offer your support,

558
00:48:25,240 --> 00:48:26,880
your affection and care,

559
00:48:28,880 --> 00:48:30,680
and to see to my needs,

560
00:48:33,920 --> 00:48:36,800
it is far worse than any slander
I have endured.

561
00:48:43,640 --> 00:48:45,040
I sincerely apologize

562
00:48:46,680 --> 00:48:48,480
for not realizing it sooner.

563
00:48:51,480 --> 00:48:54,320
I am now ready to tell you

564
00:48:55,440 --> 00:48:58,560
whom I wish you to be in my life.

565
00:49:06,600 --> 00:49:08,320
Allow me to care for you

566
00:49:08,400 --> 00:49:10,920
as my dearest beloved, Kaew.

567
00:50:08,280 --> 00:50:09,320
I shall allow it,

568
00:50:09,400 --> 00:50:10,600
Jom, my beloved.

569
00:51:00,400 --> 00:51:01,760
Physician!

570
00:51:02,480 --> 00:51:03,720
Master Kaew!

571
00:51:17,320 --> 00:51:19,520
I had to venture from Master Jom's

572
00:51:20,400 --> 00:51:21,760
to Master Kaew's manor

573
00:51:21,840 --> 00:51:24,440
and then the canal market.

574
00:51:28,920 --> 00:51:31,400
You wish for us to escort you into…

575
00:51:33,440 --> 00:51:35,200
the House of Pleasure?

576
00:51:36,640 --> 00:51:37,640
Yes.

577
00:51:37,720 --> 00:51:40,440
Tonight is the fifteenth night
of the waning moon.

578
00:51:40,520 --> 00:51:43,680
Cherd should smuggle opium tonight,
if true.

579
00:51:45,440 --> 00:51:46,800
Your task is

580
00:51:46,880 --> 00:51:49,800
to uncover exactly
which temple that hut lies behind.

581
00:51:50,480 --> 00:51:52,160
Through the House of Pleasure?

582
00:51:54,960 --> 00:51:56,720
Through the House of Pleasure.

583
00:51:57,280 --> 00:52:00,040
That is because Pim,
a lady at the House of Pleasure,

584
00:52:00,120 --> 00:52:01,520
may well know the truth.

585
00:52:01,600 --> 00:52:03,840
Did you pay any heed to his words,

586
00:52:03,920 --> 00:52:07,120
or was your mind
wholly fixed on that one thing?

587
00:52:09,680 --> 00:52:10,640
As for Phop,

588
00:52:10,720 --> 00:52:12,680
dispatch the patrol
to reinforce the position

589
00:52:12,760 --> 00:52:14,360
once the temple has been identified.

590
00:52:14,440 --> 00:52:15,640
Yes.

591
00:52:16,200 --> 00:52:17,440
I must make haste and depart.

592
00:52:17,520 --> 00:52:20,600
Klao, tell Kaew and Jom of our plan.

593
00:52:26,760 --> 00:52:29,440
Keep yourself safe, my dearest.

594
00:52:33,960 --> 00:52:34,800
Understood.

595
00:52:35,920 --> 00:52:37,960
Once this night is over,

596
00:52:39,080 --> 00:52:41,720
we shall at last live in peace.

597
00:52:42,360 --> 00:52:44,720
Once this night is over,

598
00:52:44,800 --> 00:52:46,880
I shall ask my father
for your hand in marriage.

599
00:53:07,920 --> 00:53:09,720
You are right-handed, are you not?

600
00:53:10,520 --> 00:53:12,280
Why then wield your sword left-handed?

601
00:53:13,960 --> 00:53:15,800
One must keep the dominant hand free,

602
00:53:16,760 --> 00:53:18,280
so the sword may be drawn thus.

603
00:53:23,320 --> 00:53:24,160
Why the question?

604
00:53:24,920 --> 00:53:27,320
It vaguely came to me that

605
00:53:27,400 --> 00:53:30,080
the official who visited my father
in Phichit

606
00:53:32,440 --> 00:53:33,960
<i>carried his sword in his right hand.</i>

607
00:53:35,040 --> 00:53:36,080
That would imply that

608
00:53:37,120 --> 00:53:38,960
he is left-handed, would it not?

609
00:53:46,000 --> 00:53:47,880
My deepest thanks to you.

610
00:53:47,960 --> 00:53:49,200
I now see clearly

611
00:53:49,280 --> 00:53:51,720
how I must proceed
with this investigation.

612
00:53:54,520 --> 00:53:55,640
I shall take my leave now.

613
00:53:56,840 --> 00:53:58,920
Once the truth is found,
hasten to my department.

614
00:54:23,320 --> 00:54:24,160
Now then…

615
00:54:25,760 --> 00:54:26,920
Our plan

616
00:54:27,640 --> 00:54:28,880
is as follows.

617
00:54:30,800 --> 00:54:32,800
<i>Pim has been shunning me,</i>

618
00:54:32,880 --> 00:54:35,200
<i>yet I must speak with her.</i>

619
00:54:36,880 --> 00:54:39,360
<i>One of us must wear a disguise</i>
<i>and call for her.</i>

620
00:54:50,440 --> 00:54:51,560
Me!

621
00:54:51,640 --> 00:54:53,800
I shall take upon myself
this daunting task.

622
00:54:53,880 --> 00:54:55,480
You seem quite eager, Jom.

623
00:54:59,880 --> 00:55:04,520
We will need Jom for our backup plan.

624
00:55:05,440 --> 00:55:06,480
So…

625
00:55:07,040 --> 00:55:10,120
The one who assumes the guise shall be…

626
00:55:14,640 --> 00:55:17,240
I am here to officially inspect
the House of Pleasure!

627
00:55:19,720 --> 00:55:21,400
Inspect this establishment, I hear?

628
00:55:24,440 --> 00:55:27,000
We have paid our dues

629
00:55:27,680 --> 00:55:29,200
and tributes

630
00:55:29,280 --> 00:55:30,920
to the authorities without fail.

631
00:55:34,240 --> 00:55:35,720
Do not be shy, Master.

632
00:55:35,800 --> 00:55:37,720
If it is pleasure you seek,

633
00:55:37,800 --> 00:55:39,840
then speak your mind plainly.

634
00:55:39,920 --> 00:55:42,880
I shall offer you my service.

635
00:55:53,520 --> 00:55:54,680
Is Pim within?

636
00:55:55,920 --> 00:55:57,840
She is not here.

637
00:56:01,520 --> 00:56:03,880
I, Puang, shall take her stead.

638
00:56:03,960 --> 00:56:05,600
Compelling, is she not?

639
00:56:10,520 --> 00:56:11,600
If that is the case,

640
00:56:12,160 --> 00:56:13,560
then I shall take my leave.

641
00:56:14,160 --> 00:56:15,800
<i>What if Kaew's ruse were to falter?</i>

642
00:56:15,880 --> 00:56:17,080
Deary me…

643
00:56:17,160 --> 00:56:19,000
you have indeed
placed your trust in me, Jom.

644
00:56:22,120 --> 00:56:23,200
I simply…

645
00:56:24,640 --> 00:56:27,240
I am merely devising another plan,
my Kaew.

646
00:56:30,880 --> 00:56:32,320
This is beyond me.

647
00:56:46,000 --> 00:56:46,840
I…

648
00:56:51,920 --> 00:56:52,960
I am here to see Pim.

649
00:57:01,000 --> 00:57:02,920
She is not here.

650
00:57:05,280 --> 00:57:07,480
I, Puang, shall take her stead.

651
00:57:09,200 --> 00:57:10,880
Allow us

652
00:57:10,960 --> 00:57:13,440
to satisfy you, Master.

653
00:57:29,800 --> 00:57:31,600
I cannot do it!

654
00:57:32,920 --> 00:57:34,080
I simply cannot!

655
00:57:36,400 --> 00:57:38,280
I cannot do this.

656
00:57:38,360 --> 00:57:40,200
I cannot!

657
00:57:48,320 --> 00:57:50,000
Even Jom has failed.

658
00:57:51,920 --> 00:57:52,920
Now then,

659
00:57:53,640 --> 00:57:56,840
the time has come for my ultimate gambit.

660
00:57:56,920 --> 00:57:58,640
-Ultimate gambit?
-Ultimate gambit?

661
00:57:58,720 --> 00:57:59,640
Yes!

662
00:57:59,720 --> 00:58:02,000
It shall go as follows.

663
00:58:02,080 --> 00:58:03,160
Help!

664
00:58:05,320 --> 00:58:07,280
I have been bitten by a serpent!

665
00:58:10,400 --> 00:58:12,840
Ouch!

666
00:58:15,160 --> 00:58:16,080
Ouch!

667
00:58:19,120 --> 00:58:21,720
Ow!

668
00:58:26,000 --> 00:58:28,040
A serpent took hold of him.

669
00:58:32,920 --> 00:58:34,160
Good heavens!

670
00:58:34,240 --> 00:58:35,440
Good ladies,

671
00:58:35,520 --> 00:58:37,200
kindly bring a physician to treat him.

672
00:58:43,760 --> 00:58:45,720
Where were you bitten?

673
00:58:45,800 --> 00:58:47,480
-Look for the bite mark?
-I see nothing.

674
00:58:48,520 --> 00:58:50,400
-A serpent of what kind?
-I could not see…

675
00:58:50,480 --> 00:58:52,280
I shall draw the venom out myself!

676
00:58:52,360 --> 00:58:53,960
I shall take on the task as well.

677
00:58:54,040 --> 00:58:55,440
-Where is it?
-I can't find it.

678
00:58:55,520 --> 00:58:56,360
Where is it?

679
00:58:56,440 --> 00:58:57,880
-Pray, tell.
-Up here?

680
00:58:57,960 --> 00:58:58,840
I can't find it.

681
00:58:58,920 --> 00:59:00,960
-It is not down here.
-None to be found here.

682
00:59:01,040 --> 00:59:03,160
What kind of serpent bit you?

683
00:59:03,240 --> 00:59:04,760
I have yet to find one.

684
00:59:05,880 --> 00:59:07,680
I too shall draw out the venom!

685
00:59:07,760 --> 00:59:09,600
I had better take the task.

686
00:59:09,680 --> 00:59:11,040
-Where?
-Here, is it not?

687
00:59:11,120 --> 00:59:13,680
-There, is it?
-Oh, allow me to do it.

688
00:59:13,760 --> 00:59:14,920
Ow!

689
00:59:15,000 --> 00:59:16,520
Pray, loosen your garments.

690
00:59:16,600 --> 00:59:18,040
Did it bite you in the arm?

691
00:59:18,120 --> 00:59:19,040
Your arm, is it not?

692
00:59:19,720 --> 00:59:20,560
Or is it your leg?

693
00:59:20,680 --> 00:59:21,560
His leg…

694
00:59:21,640 --> 00:59:23,320
-His arm…
-Is it here?

695
00:59:24,360 --> 00:59:25,680
Curses!

696
00:59:25,760 --> 00:59:29,000
Can I not have a single night of peace
in my own establishment?

697
00:59:30,840 --> 00:59:33,680
-Oh, make way!
-She is coming.

698
00:59:33,760 --> 00:59:36,280
What is all this commotion?

699
00:59:40,200 --> 00:59:41,040
Physician Jom?

700
00:59:45,480 --> 00:59:46,320
Kaew?

701
00:59:46,960 --> 00:59:48,400
The son of High Lord Sintaranurak?

702
00:59:50,240 --> 00:59:51,840
What brought both of you here?

703
01:00:01,960 --> 01:00:02,800
Pim!

704
01:00:06,800 --> 01:00:08,120
You said that we are friends.

705
01:00:09,120 --> 01:00:10,680
Why then turn your face from me?

706
01:00:44,080 --> 01:00:46,280
It is best for you
to stay away from me, Klao.

707
01:00:46,920 --> 01:00:48,360
Cease this charade of illness.

708
01:00:49,960 --> 01:00:51,200
Speak truthfully,

709
01:00:52,360 --> 01:00:54,240
and tell me why you shun me.

710
01:00:55,760 --> 01:00:56,800
Is Cherd the reason?

711
01:00:57,560 --> 01:00:58,600
What did he do to you?

712
01:01:02,400 --> 01:01:04,360
He is consumed with jealousy.

713
01:01:06,520 --> 01:01:08,280
He has forbidden me from coming near you.

714
01:01:11,720 --> 01:01:14,120
Should I disobey, he shall have me killed!

715
01:01:21,120 --> 01:01:23,360
I beg you,
have compassion for my situation.

716
01:01:28,080 --> 01:01:30,520
Leave this establishment, I pray.

717
01:01:36,120 --> 01:01:36,960
Pim.

718
01:01:49,560 --> 01:01:50,800
You cry

719
01:01:51,440 --> 01:01:52,960
because you are afraid, do you not?

720
01:01:55,120 --> 01:01:56,440
Or perhaps you believe…

721
01:01:58,160 --> 01:02:00,120
you were the cause
of my previous disappearance?

722
01:02:06,320 --> 01:02:08,640
The night we last met,

723
01:02:11,320 --> 01:02:12,800
I did ask you

724
01:02:14,120 --> 01:02:15,960
for the location of the meeting place.

725
01:02:20,800 --> 01:02:22,040
Klao…

726
01:02:25,200 --> 01:02:27,480
Have your memories returned?

727
01:02:33,960 --> 01:02:34,800
Yes.

728
01:02:37,120 --> 01:02:38,080
At present,

729
01:02:38,160 --> 01:02:41,360
Phop and I are investigating this matter.

730
01:02:45,000 --> 01:02:46,920
It has all come back to me.

731
01:02:48,240 --> 01:02:51,160
There is no point in lying
or hiding from me any further.

732
01:02:56,160 --> 01:02:57,720
Simply give me the answer

733
01:02:59,040 --> 01:03:00,800
and I shall no longer set foot here again.

734
01:03:04,160 --> 01:03:07,560
That abandoned hut by the pond
near the temple,

735
01:03:10,000 --> 01:03:11,320
to which temple does it belong?

736
01:03:22,480 --> 01:03:23,560
Is Kla not here?

737
01:03:25,840 --> 01:03:26,920
He is not.

738
01:03:27,000 --> 01:03:29,160
He has been keeping a close eye
on Cherd, my Lord.

739
01:03:30,720 --> 01:03:31,840
Leave, all of you.

740
01:03:46,280 --> 01:03:50,080
Wat Sema Thong is the first temple
we come across as we sail along the river.

741
01:03:51,080 --> 01:03:53,280
However, if we go ashore from Sam Khok,

742
01:03:53,960 --> 01:03:57,680
where we have seized opium
on several occasions,

743
01:03:57,760 --> 01:03:59,200
it would instead be Wat Sema Khu.

744
01:04:04,320 --> 01:04:05,160
Lord Phop.

745
01:04:06,600 --> 01:04:09,480
Can you not put your doubts
about that hut to rest?

746
01:04:13,080 --> 01:04:14,360
I simply cannot.

747
01:04:15,080 --> 01:04:18,080
Wat Sema Khu
lies close to the canal market.

748
01:04:18,760 --> 01:04:19,840
Cherd's territory.

749
01:04:20,680 --> 01:04:22,840
It lies also within

750
01:04:22,920 --> 01:04:25,960
you and your father's jurisdiction.

751
01:04:31,800 --> 01:04:32,680
Lord Phop.

752
01:04:34,400 --> 01:04:36,040
Are you suspicious of me?

753
01:04:41,360 --> 01:04:42,800
Certainly not, Lord Harn.

754
01:04:44,960 --> 01:04:47,360
My suspicion lies with your father.

755
01:04:50,480 --> 01:04:51,320
Impossible.

756
01:04:52,800 --> 01:04:54,560
How would my father do such a thing?

757
01:04:54,640 --> 01:04:56,120
I have reasons to believe,

758
01:04:56,720 --> 01:04:59,080
but time is of the essence.

759
01:04:59,800 --> 01:05:00,760
Lord Harn,

760
01:05:01,440 --> 01:05:03,280
you have the power to set wrongs right.

761
01:05:04,680 --> 01:05:07,000
At this hour,
I have no one else to rely on but you.

762
01:05:09,120 --> 01:05:10,840
Should your father be guiltless,

763
01:05:12,040 --> 01:05:13,360
then take it

764
01:05:14,160 --> 01:05:15,960
as my own misunderstanding.

765
01:05:24,360 --> 01:05:25,360
If such is the case,

766
01:05:28,120 --> 01:05:29,680
what would you have me do?

767
01:05:46,920 --> 01:05:48,240
Pim.

768
01:05:48,320 --> 01:05:50,280
No need for such formalities between us.

769
01:05:58,520 --> 01:06:01,240
Let me serve you with all my heart.

770
01:06:05,320 --> 01:06:06,680
And I beg of you…

771
01:06:07,960 --> 01:06:09,680
never return to this place again

772
01:06:11,000 --> 01:06:13,760
lest you invite disaster upon yourself.

773
01:06:19,320 --> 01:06:20,760
What is the meaning of that?

774
01:06:20,840 --> 01:06:23,680
But that hut…

775
01:06:24,320 --> 01:06:26,440
It is the meeting place, is it not?

776
01:06:28,640 --> 01:06:29,960
Indeed it is.

777
01:06:33,160 --> 01:06:35,800
It is a staging ground
for opium smuggled from Sam Khok,

778
01:06:38,000 --> 01:06:39,960
bound for the capital.

779
01:06:40,600 --> 01:06:41,440
And…

780
01:06:42,000 --> 01:06:42,920
So…

781
01:06:44,040 --> 01:06:45,280
Which temple is it?

782
01:06:46,400 --> 01:06:47,720
Is it Wat Sema Muang,

783
01:06:47,800 --> 01:06:49,240
Wat Sema Khu,

784
01:06:49,320 --> 01:06:50,560
or Wat Sema Thong?

785
01:06:52,800 --> 01:06:54,880
It is Wat Sema Muang.

786
01:07:02,520 --> 01:07:05,200
My heart is burdened with guilt.

787
01:07:06,840 --> 01:07:09,480
The last time I spoke thus,

788
01:07:10,640 --> 01:07:12,160
rumors reached my ears

789
01:07:13,040 --> 01:07:14,800
that you had perished.

790
01:07:15,880 --> 01:07:19,760
I have tormented myself
in every waking moment,

791
01:07:20,800 --> 01:07:25,040
believing I was the cause of your demise.

792
01:07:33,480 --> 01:07:34,440
No wonder

793
01:07:35,920 --> 01:07:37,840
you wept…

794
01:07:42,320 --> 01:07:44,120
when we first met again.

795
01:07:48,480 --> 01:07:50,440
You have my deepest gratitude, Pim.

796
01:07:53,840 --> 01:07:55,280
What you have done is right.

797
01:07:56,880 --> 01:07:58,600
I shall leave this place at once

798
01:08:00,280 --> 01:08:02,040
and never return.

799
01:08:06,600 --> 01:08:08,760
I shall not cause you trouble again.

800
01:08:13,200 --> 01:08:14,720
But…

801
01:08:14,800 --> 01:08:17,000
if you still hold on to me thus,

802
01:08:18,600 --> 01:08:20,240
how then could I rise and leave?

803
01:08:26,760 --> 01:08:30,880
Grant me your forgiveness,
I beg of you, Klao.

804
01:08:32,520 --> 01:08:34,080
Forgiveness?

805
01:09:01,520 --> 01:09:02,399
Master.

806
01:09:02,479 --> 01:09:04,319
Calm yourself, A-Chai.

807
01:09:11,800 --> 01:09:13,680
You need not trouble yourself

808
01:09:13,760 --> 01:09:15,319
to serve me tea, High Lord.

809
01:09:17,000 --> 01:09:19,080
Allow me to serve you.

810
01:09:33,880 --> 01:09:36,600
You have gone to great lengths
to summon me here.

811
01:09:37,520 --> 01:09:38,680
What is the matter?

812
01:09:39,600 --> 01:09:40,880
Is it something pleasant?

813
01:09:45,760 --> 01:09:47,160
Indeed it is.

814
01:09:50,399 --> 01:09:51,359
At last,

815
01:09:52,399 --> 01:09:53,880
the truth has come to light.

816
01:09:59,360 --> 01:10:00,640
The truth?

817
01:10:01,680 --> 01:10:04,600
Is it regarding
Phop declining his own marriage?

818
01:10:04,680 --> 01:10:06,360
No.

819
01:10:06,440 --> 01:10:07,400
It is not so.

820
01:10:08,040 --> 01:10:09,520
What has come to light is that

821
01:10:10,640 --> 01:10:13,400
you framed Lord Preechaphibal,

822
01:10:15,320 --> 01:10:17,320
permitting the junks carrying opium

823
01:10:19,320 --> 01:10:23,280
to sail into the river's mouth
without being searched.

824
01:10:23,960 --> 01:10:27,640
Oh, compose yourself
and speak at a steady pace.

825
01:10:27,720 --> 01:10:30,400
You shall be out of breath
if you continue thus.

826
01:10:33,240 --> 01:10:34,440
Now then…

827
01:10:35,320 --> 01:10:36,680
Was it you

828
01:10:38,280 --> 01:10:41,640
who orchestrated all of this?

829
01:10:54,440 --> 01:10:55,280
Indeed.

830
01:10:58,440 --> 01:11:00,400
And what exactly do you think you can do?

831
01:11:04,800 --> 01:11:05,920
Master.

832
01:11:06,920 --> 01:11:08,440
<i>Are you certain this is the way</i>

833
01:11:09,200 --> 01:11:11,400
that leads to your father's stash?

834
01:11:13,320 --> 01:11:14,240
Assuredly.

835
01:11:14,800 --> 01:11:17,320
He has been visiting Wat Sema Khu
more often of late.

836
01:11:17,920 --> 01:11:19,200
Thus, this must be the place.

837
01:11:23,200 --> 01:11:24,680
Make haste.

838
01:11:24,760 --> 01:11:25,880
By my reckoning,

839
01:11:25,960 --> 01:11:27,800
the second period must have passed.

840
01:11:41,400 --> 01:11:42,240
Lord Harn.

841
01:11:43,120 --> 01:11:45,600
Does the hut you spoke of truly exist?

842
01:11:47,440 --> 01:11:48,280
It ought to.

843
01:11:49,320 --> 01:11:51,000
I am certain I have seen it.

844
01:11:52,520 --> 01:11:55,280
Or has my father learned of us
and had it demolished?

845
01:11:57,640 --> 01:11:59,800
How could an entire hut
vanish without a trace?

846
01:12:08,400 --> 01:12:10,400
Either that, or you have deceived me.

847
01:12:14,000 --> 01:12:16,200
Cease this charade, Lord Harn.

848
01:12:17,200 --> 01:12:18,960
I know full well you are behind this.

849
01:12:26,600 --> 01:12:28,280
If you already do,

850
01:12:29,760 --> 01:12:31,440
why then did you follow me here?

851
01:12:35,600 --> 01:12:37,200
Because I still have hope

852
01:12:38,200 --> 01:12:40,200
that a patrolman like you

853
01:12:41,000 --> 01:12:43,120
would not commit such a misdeed.

854
01:12:53,720 --> 01:12:54,800
If such is the case,

855
01:12:57,400 --> 01:13:01,000
do pray that
you make it out alive and in one piece,

856
01:13:01,640 --> 01:13:02,640
Lord Phop.

857
01:13:16,960 --> 01:13:18,880
What is it you are saying?

858
01:13:19,440 --> 01:13:21,080
In the previous incident,

859
01:13:24,000 --> 01:13:25,240
you were not in the wrong.

860
01:13:27,240 --> 01:13:28,400
Indeed.

861
01:13:31,920 --> 01:13:33,480
But this time,

862
01:13:35,840 --> 01:13:38,040
it is certain that I am.

863
01:14:34,800 --> 01:14:36,240
<i>A traitor is among us.</i>

864
01:14:36,320 --> 01:14:38,640
-Summon the patrols here at once.
-I cannot do this.

865
01:14:41,440 --> 01:14:42,600
I place full trust in you.

866
01:14:42,680 --> 01:14:45,880
Never have I known a soul
so wise and resilient as you.

867
01:14:49,120 --> 01:14:52,080
Fear not
that you will be alone in hell,

868
01:14:52,160 --> 01:14:54,240
for your good brother

869
01:14:54,840 --> 01:14:56,800
shall soon join you.

870
01:15:02,640 --> 01:15:05,600
<i>I call upon the Buddha as my witness.</i>

871
01:15:05,680 --> 01:15:08,400
<i>My heart belongs to you alone.</i>

872
01:15:08,480 --> 01:15:10,360
<i>After this day,</i>

873
01:15:10,440 --> 01:15:12,200
<i>if I am gone,</i>

874
01:15:12,840 --> 01:15:14,720
promise me you will live well.
